SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Guide::
	.string "Welcome to the MUSEUM OF TIME. One\n"
	.string "plate for each ECHO. Read them in\p"
	.string "the order you met them.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Plate0::
	.string "RAIKOU: It crossed KINDLE ROAD\n"
	.string "once. The ground still remembers\p"
	.string "its thunder.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Plate1::
	.string "ENTEI: It burned a path across CAPE\n"
	.string "BRINK. The ash never settled.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Plate2::
	.string "SUICUNE: The BOND BRIDGE rings when\n"
	.string "it passes. The water clears for it.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Plate3::
	.string "REGICE: Cold older than the island.\n"
	.string "It waits at the end of ICEFALL\p"
	.string "CAVE.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Plate4::
	.string "REGISTEEL: Iron that was never\n"
	.string "forged. The MEADOW grows around it.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Plate5::
	.string "REGIROCK: Stone that remembers\n"
	.string "every footstep in RUIN VALLEY.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Plate6::
	.string "CELEBI: It showed the way through\n"
	.string "time. The moss still glows where it\p"
	.string "slept.$"

SaffronCity_HomeN_Text_Blank::
	.string "The plate is blank. Nothing has\n"
	.string "been written here yet.$"
